"\\qquad\n"
"x(t_0) = x_0,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:17
msgid "partitioning reversible ($f_J$), dissipative ($f_M$), boundary-port ($f_G$), and reaction ($f_N$) tendencies. `relic.computation.solvers` is the single solver owner (`SolverBase`, `SolverRegistry`, `SolverFactory`); scientific Functors never instantiate private solver registries."
msgstr "将倾向项划分为可逆项（$f_J$）、耗散项（$f_M$）、边界端口项（$f_G$）与反应项（$f_N$）。`relic.computation.solvers` 是唯一求解器归属模块（`SolverBase`、`SolverRegistry`、`SolverFactory`）；科学算子（Functor）绝不实例化私有求解器注册表。"

