#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:36
msgid "`RK4Solver` advances smooth non-stiff systems on fixed `float64` time grids via four stage evaluations:"
msgstr "`RK4Solver` 在固定 `float64` 时间网格上通过四次级求值推进光滑非刚性系统："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:39
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"k_1 = f(t_n, x_n), \\quad\n"
"k_2 = f\\!\\left(t_n + \\tfrac{1}{2}\\Delta t,\\; x_n + \\tfrac{1}{2}\\Delta t\\,k_1\\right), \\quad\n"
"k_3 = f\\!\\left(t_n + \\tfrac{1}{2}\\Delta t,\\; x_n + \\tfrac{1}{2}\\Delta t\\,k_2\\right), \\quad\n"
"k_4 = f(t_n + \\Delta t,\\; x_n + \\Delta t\\,k_3),\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"k_1 = f(t_n, x_n), \\quad\n"
"k_2 = f\\!\\left(t_n + \\tfrac{1}{2}\\Delta t,\\; x_n + \\tfrac{1}{2}\\Delta t\\,k_1\\right), \\quad\n"
"k_3 = f\\!\\left(t_n + \\tfrac{1}{2}\\Delta t,\\; x_n + \\tfrac{1}{2}\\Delta t\\,k_2\\right), \\quad\n"
"k_4 = f(t_n + \\Delta t,\\; x_n + \\Delta t\\,k_3),\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:46
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"x_{n+1} = x_n + \\frac{\\Delta t}{6}\\left(k_1 + 2k_2 + 2k_3 + k_4\\right).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"x_{n+1} = x_n + \\frac{\\Delta t}{6}\\left(k_1 + 2k_2 + 2k_3 + k_4\\right).\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:50
msgid "`BackwardEulerSolver`, `ImplicitMidpointSolver`, `CrankNicolsonSolver` (weight $\\vartheta = 0.5$ default), and `IMEXEulerSolver` ($f = f_{\\mathrm{exp}} + f_{\\mathrm{imp}}$) discretize:"
msgstr "`BackwardEulerSolver`、`ImplicitMidpointSolver`、`CrankNicolsonSolver`（默认权重 $\\vartheta = 0.5$）与 `IMEXEulerSolver`（$f = f_{\\mathrm{exp}} + f_{\\mathrm{imp}}$）离散格式如下："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:54
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"x_{n+1} = x_n + \\Delta t\\,f(t_{n+1}, x_{n+1}) \\;\\; (\\text{Backward Euler}),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"x_{n+1} = x_n + \\Delta t\\,f\\!\\left(t_n + \\tfrac{1}{2}\\Delta t,\\; \\tfrac{1}{2}(x_n + x_{n+1})\\right) \\;\\; (\\text{Implicit Midpoint}),\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"x_{n+1} = x_n + \\Delta t\\,f(t_{n+1}, x_{n+1}) \\;\\; (\\text{Backward Euler}),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"x_{n+1} = x_n + \\Delta t\\,f\\!\\left(t_n + \\tfrac{1}{2}\\Delta t,\\; \\tfrac{1}{2}(x_n + x_{n+1})\\right) \\;\\; (\\text{Implicit Midpoint}),\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:60
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"x_{n+1} = x_n + \\Delta t\\left[(1 - \\vartheta)f(t_n, x_n) + \\vartheta f(t_{n+1}, x_{n+1})\\right] \\;\\; (\\text{Crank-Nicolson } \\vartheta),\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"x_{n+1} = x_n + \\Delta t\\left[(1 - \\vartheta)f(t_n, x_n) + \\vartheta f(t_{n+1}, x_{n+1})\\right] \\;\\; (\\text{Crank-Nicolson } \\vartheta),\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:64
msgid ""
"\n"
"x_{n+1} = x_n + \\Delta t\\,f_{\\mathrm{exp}}(t_n, x_n) + \\Delta t\\,f_{\\mathrm{imp}}(t_{n+1}, x_{n+1}) \\;\\; (\\text{IMEX Euler}).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"x_{n+1} = x_n + \\Delta t\\,f_{\\mathrm{exp}}(t_n, x_n) + \\Delta t\\,f_{\\mathrm{imp}}(t_{n+1}, x_{n+1}) \\;\\; (\\text{IMEX Euler}).\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:68
#, python-brace-format
msgid "All four implicit solvers iterate fixed-point updates (damped Picard $x^{(k+1)} = \\omega G(x^{(k)}) + (1 - \\omega)x^{(k)}$ with default `damping_factor` $\\omega = 1.0$ and `max_iterations = 50` in Backward Euler and IMEX Euler; undamped fixed-point in Implicit Midpoint and Crank-Nicolson) without internal Newton-Raphson Jacobians. Consequently, A-stability of the underlying quadrature does not lift the Picard contraction restriction ($\\Delta t\\,L_f < 1$, $\\frac{1}{2}\\Delta t\\,L_f < 1$, or $\\vartheta\\Delta t\\,L_f < 1$). Finite non-convergent iterates return `SolverStatus.MAX_ITERATIONS` from `solve()` and raise `SolverStepError` in `step()` / `forward()`; non-finite iterates raise `ValueError` immediately. Standalone solvers perform fixed-grid stepping with no internal adaptive step resizing."
msgstr "上述四类隐式求解器均采用无内部 Newton-Raphson 雅可比矩阵的不动点迭代更新（后向欧拉与 IMEX 欧拉采用阻尼皮卡格式 $x^{(k+1)} = \\omega G(x^{(k)}) + (1 - \\omega)x^{(k)}$，默认 `damping_factor` $\\omega = 1.0$ 且 `max_iterations = 50`；隐式中点法与 Crank-Nicolson 采用无阻尼不动点格式）。因此，底层求积格式的 A-稳定性并不解除皮卡压缩限制（$\\Delta t\\,L_f < 1$、$\\frac{1}{2}\\Delta t\\,L_f < 1$ 或 $\\vartheta\\Delta t\\,L_f < 1$）。有限但未收敛的迭代在 `solve()` 中返回 `SolverStatus.MAX_ITERATIONS`，并在 `step()` / `forward()` 中抛出 `SolverStepError`；非有限迭代值立即抛出 `ValueError`。独立求解器执行固定网格步进，内部不设自适应步长调整。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:81
msgid "For discrete-gradient structure preservation on energy $E$ and entropy $S$ with $\\overline{\\nabla}F(x_n, x_{n+1})^{\\mathsf{T}}(x_{n+1} - x_n) = F(x_{n+1}) - F(x_n)$, skew $J_h^{\\mathsf{T}} = -J_h$ preserves energy $E(x_{n+1}) - E(x_n) = \\Delta t\\,\\overline{\\nabla}E^{\\mathsf{T}} J_h \\overline{\\nabla}E = 0$, and $M_h \\succeq 0$ guarantees discrete entropy production $S(x_{n+1}) - S(x_n) = \\Delta t\\,\\overline{\\nabla}S^{\\mathsf{T}} M_h \\overline{\\nabla}S \\ge 0$ when functional, discrete gradient, and accepted step are explicitly bound."
msgstr "对于能量 $E$ 与熵 $S$ 上的离散梯度保结构格式，当满足 $\\overline{\\nabla}F(x_n, x_{n+1})^{\\mathsf{T}}(x_{n+1} - x_n) = F(x_{n+1}) - F(x_n)$ 且泛函、离散梯度与已接受步显式绑定时，反对称算子 $J_h^{\\mathsf{T}} = -J_h$ 保持能量守恒 $E(x_{n+1}) - E(x_n) = \\Delta t\\,\\overline{\\nabla}E^{\\mathsf{T}} J_h \\overline{\\nabla}E = 0$，半正定算子 $M_h \\succeq 0$ 保证离散熵产生非负 $S(x_{n+1}) - S(x_n) = \\Delta t\\,\\overline{\\nabla}S^{\\mathsf{T}} M_h \\overline{\\nabla}S \\ge 0$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:89
msgid "Reference stiff solver families (`[N]`)"
msgstr "参考刚性求解器族（`[N]`）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:91
msgid "*Methods of Ecological Analysis* (Chapters 25--26) derives four stiff Jacobian-based time-integration families as analytical benchmarks (`[N]` in `relic.computation.solvers`):"
msgstr "《生态学分析方法》（第 25--26 章）推导了四类基于雅可比矩阵的刚性时间积分族作为解析基准（在 `relic.computation.solvers` 中标记为 `[N]`）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:95
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Variable-order BDF ($k = 1, \\dots, 5$)**: $\\sum_{j=0}^k \\alpha_j x_{n+1-j} = \\Delta t\\,\\beta_0 f(t_{n+1}, x_{n+1})$, $A(\\alpha)$-stable for stiff reaction-DAE kinetics;"
msgstr "**变阶 BDF（$k = 1, \\dots, 5$）**：$\\sum_{j=0}^k \\alpha_j x_{n+1-j} = \\Delta t\\,\\beta_0 f(t_{n+1}, x_{n+1})$，对刚性反应-DAE 动力学具有 $A(\\alpha)$-稳定性；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:96
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Linearly implicit Rosenbrock-W**: $(I - \\gamma \\Delta t J_n) k_i = f(\\dots) + \\Delta t J_n \\sum_{j < i} \\gamma_{ij} k_j$ ($J_n \\approx \\partial f / \\partial x$), avoiding nonlinear Newton loops via one linear solve per stage;"
msgstr "**线性隐式 Rosenbrock-W**：$(I - \\gamma \\Delta t J_n) k_i = f(\\dots) + \\Delta t J_n \\sum_{j < i} \\gamma_{ij} k_j$（$J_n \\approx \\partial f / \\partial x$），每级仅需一次线性求解即可免除非线性牛顿循环；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:97
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**High-order IMEX-ARK**: paired explicit/diagonally-implicit Butcher tableaux $(\\tilde{A}, \\tilde{b}, \\tilde{c})$ and $(A, b, c)$ treating advection/reactions explicitly and stiff vertical diffusion implicitly beyond order 1; and"
msgstr "**高阶 IMEX-ARK**：配对显式与对角隐式 Butcher 表 $(\\tilde{A}, \\tilde{b}, \\tilde{c})$ 及 $(A, b, c)$，在一阶以上精度下显式处理平流/反应项并隐式处理刚性垂向扩散项；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:98
msgid "**Jacobian-free Newton-Krylov (JFNK)**: inner GMRES/BiCGSTAB solves approximating directional derivatives $J(x)v \\approx [f(x + \\varepsilon v) - f(x)]/\\varepsilon$ for large coupled nonlinear residuals."
msgstr "**无雅可比牛顿-克雷洛夫（Jacobian-free Newton-Krylov, JFNK）**：针对大规模耦合非线性残差，采用内层广义极小残量法（Generalized Minimal Residual, GMRES）/双共轭梯度稳定法（Biconjugate Gradient Stabilized, BiCGSTAB）求解并通过 $J(x)v \\approx [f(x + \\varepsilon v) - f(x)]/\\varepsilon$ 逼近方向导数。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:100
msgid "Tridiagonal linear and bracketed nonlinear solvers (`[I]`)"
msgstr "三对角线性求解器与有界区间非线性求解器（`[I]`）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:102
msgid "1D vertical diffusion and linearized Richards discretizations assemble tridiagonal systems $A x = d$ with lower, main, and upper diagonals $(a_i, b_i, c_i)$. `ThomasAlgorithmSolver` and `solve_tridiagonal_thomas` (`relic.computation.solvers.linear`) execute forward elimination and back substitution:"
msgstr "一维垂向扩散与线性化 Richards 离散组装具有下对角线、主对角线与上对角线 $(a_i, b_i, c_i)$ 的三对角方程组 $A x = d$。`ThomasAlgorithmSolver` 与 `solve_tridiagonal_thomas`（`relic.computation.solvers.linear`）执行前向消元与回代："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:108
msgid ""
"\n"
"p_i = b_i - a_i c_{i-1}' \\;\\; (p_0 = b_0),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"c_i' = \\frac{c_i}{p_i},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"d_i' = \\frac{d_i - a_i d_{i-1}'}{p_i},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"x_n = d_n', \\quad x_i = d_i' - c_i' x_{i+1}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"p_i = b_i - a_i c_{i-1}' \\;\\; (p_0 = b_0),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"c_i' = \\frac{c_i}{p_i},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"d_i' = \\frac{d_i - a_i d_{i-1}'}{p_i},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"x_n = d_n', \\quad x_i = d_i' - c_i' x_{i+1}.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:118
msgid "Any non-finite pivot or near-zero pivot satisfying $\\lvert p_i \\rvert \\le \\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}} s_i$ (where $s_i$ is row $i$'s $\\ell_\\infty$ norm) raises `ValueError` without pivot regularization. Enabling `check_stability` (`computation.solvers.thomas.check_stability`) records the Varah (1975) condition-number bound in `SolverResult` metadata."
msgstr "任何非有限主元或满足 $\\lvert p_i \\rvert \\le \\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}} s_i$（其中 $s_i$ 为第 $i$ 行的 $\\ell_\\infty$ 范数）的近零主元均直接抛出 `ValueError`，不作主元正则化。启用 `check_stability`（`computation.solvers.thomas.check_stability`）时，将在 `SolverResult` 元数据中记录 Varah（1975）条件数界。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:124
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`BracketedBisectionSolver` (`relic.computation.solvers.nonlinear`) solves scalar algebraic constraints $g(z^\\ast; \\boldsymbol{\\theta}) = 0$ on sign-change brackets $[a, b]$ ($g(a)g(b) \\le 0$) and propagates exact implicit-function sensitivities through `_ImplicitRootGradient`:"
msgstr "`BracketedBisectionSolver`（`relic.computation.solvers.nonlinear`）在变号有界区间 $[a, b]$（$g(a)g(b) \\le 0$）上求解标量代数约束 $g(z^\\ast; \\boldsymbol{\\theta}) = 0$，并通过 `_ImplicitRootGradient` 传播精确隐函数灵敏度："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:129
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\partial z^\\ast}{\\partial \\boldsymbol{\\theta}}\n"
"= -\\left(\\frac{\\partial g(z^\\ast, \\boldsymbol{\\theta})}{\\partial z}\\right)^{-1}\n"
"\\frac{\\partial g(z^\\ast, \\boldsymbol{\\theta})}{\\partial \\boldsymbol{\\theta}}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\partial z^\\ast}{\\partial \\boldsymbol{\\theta}}\n"
"= -\\left(\\frac{\\partial g(z^\\ast, \\boldsymbol{\\theta})}{\\partial z}\\right)^{-1}\n"
"\\frac{\\partial g(z^\\ast, \\boldsymbol{\\theta})}{\\partial \\boldsymbol{\\theta}}.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:135
msgid "Multi-rate execution, operator splitting, and step control"
msgstr "多速率执行、算子分裂与步长控制"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:137
msgid "Palindromic Strang splitting and `SubFlowAccuracy`"
msgstr "回文对称 Strang 分裂与 `SubFlowAccuracy`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:139
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`RELICSimulator` partitions registered Functors into `fast`, `medium`, and `slow` groups (`relic.core.simulator.execution_group`, `relic.core.simulator.execution_loop`). For $n \\ge 2$ ordered fast-group processes $F_1, \\dots, F_n$, `lie` mode executes $\\Phi_n^{\\Delta t} \\circ \\cdots \\circ \\Phi_1^{\\Delta t}$, whereas `strang` mode executes the palindromic $2n - 1$ composition (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapter 26):"
msgstr "`RELICSimulator` 将已注册算子划分为 `fast`、`medium` 与 `slow` 执行组（`relic.core.simulator.execution_group`、`relic.core.simulator.execution_loop`）。对于 $n \\ge 2$ 个有序快组过程 $F_1, \\dots, F_n$，`lie` 模式执行顺序复合 $\\Phi_n^{\\Delta t} \\circ \\cdots \\circ \\Phi_1^{\\Delta t}$，而 `strang` 模式执行回文对称的 $2n - 1$ 步复合（《生态学分析方法》，第 26 章）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:145
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Phi_{\\Delta t}^{\\mathrm{Strang}}\n"
"= \\Phi_1^{\\Delta t / 2} \\circ \\cdots \\circ \\Phi_{n-1}^{\\Delta t / 2}\n"
"\\circ \\Phi_n^{\\Delta t}\n"
"\\circ \\Phi_{n-1}^{\\Delta t / 2} \\circ \\cdots \\circ \\Phi_1^{\\Delta t / 2},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\Phi_{\\Delta t}^{\\mathrm{Strang}}\n"
"= \\Phi_1^{\\Delta t / 2} \\circ \\cdots \\circ \\Phi_{n-1}^{\\Delta t / 2}\n"
"\\circ \\Phi_n^{\\Delta t}\n"
"\\circ \\Phi_{n-1}^{\\Delta t / 2} \\circ \\cdots \\circ \\Phi_1^{\\Delta t / 2},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:152
msgid "passing stage start time $t$ to the leading half-steps and central full step and $t + \\Delta t / 2$ to the trailing half-steps. Each Functor declares `FunctorMetadata.sub_flow_accuracy` (`SubFlowAccuracy` in `relic.core.functor.functor_types`: `EXACT` with $p_i = \\infty$, `ORDER_2` with $p_i = 2$, `ORDER_1` with $p_i = 1$, or `UNDECLARED`), and `RELICSimulator.get_splitting_order_report()` evaluates the guaranteed one-step order:"
msgstr "向前导半步与中心整步传入阶段起始时刻 $t$，并向尾随半步传入 $t + \\Delta t / 2$。每个算子声明 `FunctorMetadata.sub_flow_accuracy`（`relic.core.functor.functor_types` 中的 `SubFlowAccuracy`：`EXACT` 对应 $p_i = \\infty$，`ORDER_2` 对应 $p_i = 2$，`ORDER_1` 对应 $p_i = 1$，或 `UNDECLARED`），由 `RELICSimulator.get_splitting_order_report()` 评估具备保证的单步阶数："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:160
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"q = \\min\\!\\left(s,\\; \\min_{1 \\le i \\le n} p_i\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"s = \\begin{cases} 1, & \\texttt{lie}, \\\\ 2, & \\texttt{strang}, \\end{cases}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"q = \\min\\!\\left(s,\\; \\min_{1 \\le i \\le n} p_i\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"s = \\begin{cases} 1, & \\texttt{lie}, \\\\ 2, & \\texttt{strang}, \\end{cases}\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:166
msgid "reporting `unverified` whenever any participating process leaves `SubFlowAccuracy.UNDECLARED`. Strang composition with first-order explicit Euler sub-integrators reduces globally to $q = 1$. In Strang mode with $n \\ge 2$, State Contract Model (SCM) flux edges between stateful fast members (including stateless relays) are refused at provider publication; `IntegrationPlan` (`relic.computation.solvers.geometric`) validates static stage DAGs as `metadata_only` (`verified=False`, `runtime_ready=False`), while runtime schedule conformance is verified via `RELICSimulator.get_composition_plan()` and `GraphExecutor.integration_plan_witness`."
msgstr "只要任一参与过程保留 `SubFlowAccuracy.UNDECLARED`，报告即标记为 `unverified`。采用一阶显式欧拉子积分器的 Strang 复合在全局退化为 $q = 1$。在 $n \\ge 2$ 的 Strang 模式下，有状态快组成员之间（含经无状态中继）的状态契约模型（State Contract Model, SCM）通量边在提供者发布阶段即被拒绝；`IntegrationPlan`（`relic.computation.solvers.geometric`）将静态阶段有向无环图（Directed Acyclic Graph, DAG）按 `metadata_only`（`verified=False`、`runtime_ready=False`）予以校验，运行时调度一致性则通过 `RELICSimulator.get_composition_plan()` 与 `GraphExecutor.integration_plan_witness` 验证。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:176
msgid "Multi-rate effective interval and boundary-rate integrals"
msgstr "多速率有效区间与边界速率积分"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:178
msgid "With base fast step $\\Delta t_f$, the `medium` group triggers across multiples of `medium_interval_seconds`, and the `slow` group triggers across multiples of `slow_interval_seconds` (or calendar month boundaries when unset), receiving the exact elapsed interval since its prior execution:"
msgstr "给定基础快步长 $\\Delta t_f$，`medium` 组在跨越 `medium_interval_seconds` 的整数倍时触发，`slow` 组在跨越 `slow_interval_seconds` 的整数倍（未设置时为日历月边界）时触发，并接收自上次执行以来的精确经过时长："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:183
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{eff}} = t_{\\mathrm{future}} - t_{\\mathrm{last}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{eff}} > 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{eff}} = t_{\\mathrm{future}} - t_{\\mathrm{last}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{eff}} > 0.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:189
msgid "Each group execution (and each Strang sub-execution) commits immediately through `StateManager`. Across substeps $k$ of duration $h_k$ within call interval $H = \\sum_k h_k$, `ACCUMULATE` amounts sum directly, `ACCUMULATE` rates (`per_timestep=False`) form time-weighted averages $\\sum_k (h_k / H) q_k$, and substepped physical boundary-port `REPLACE` rates (`allowed_in` / `allowed_out`) commit the exact interval mean $\\sum_k q_k \\Delta t_k / \\Delta t_{\\mathrm{call}}$. Declared `multirate_exchanges` supply either `hold` or piecewise-constant running `interval_mean` overlays (`exchange_mean__<id>`) to slower consumers."
msgstr "每次执行组运行（及每次 Strang 子步运行）均通过 `StateManager` 立即提交。在调用区间 $H = \\sum_k h_k$ 内各时长为 $h_k$ 的子步 $k$ 上，`ACCUMULATE` 总量直接累加，`ACCUMULATE` 速率（`per_timestep=False`）按时间加权平均 $\\sum_k (h_k / H) q_k$ 聚合，而分子步执行的物理边界端口 `REPLACE` 速率（`allowed_in` / `allowed_out`）提交精确区间均值 $\\sum_k q_k \\Delta t_k / \\Delta t_{\\mathrm{call}}$。已声明的 `multirate_exchanges` 向较慢消费者提供 `hold` 或分段常值运行期 `interval_mean` 覆盖层（`exchange_mean__<id>`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:198
msgid "RMS update-magnitude step controller"
msgstr "均方根更新幅度步长控制器"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:200
msgid "`RELICSimulator.run(...)` adapts macro-steps exclusively via the fast-group committed root-mean-square (RMS) update metric over the $m$ distinct state variables written by the fast group ($u_k = x'_k - x_k$):"
msgstr "`RELICSimulator.run(...)` 仅依据快组写入的 $m$ 个不同状态变量上的已提交均方根（Root-Mean-Square, RMS）更新度量（$u_k = x'_k - x_k$）自适应调整宏步长："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:204
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\tau_k = \\mathrm{atol} + \\mathrm{rtol}\\,\\lvert x_k \\rvert,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathrm{Err}\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{m}\\sum_{k=1}^{m}\n"
"\\operatorname{mean}\\!\\left(\\frac{u_k}{\\tau_k}\\right)^2}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\tau_k = \\mathrm{atol} + \\mathrm{rtol}\\,\\lvert x_k \\rvert,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathrm{Err}\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{m}\\sum_{k=1}^{m}\n"
"\\operatorname{mean}\\!\\left(\\frac{u_k}{\\tau_k}\\right)^2}.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:212
msgid "If $\\mathrm{Err} > 1$ and $\\Delta t > \\Delta t_{\\min}$, the step rolls back and retries once with $\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{new}} = \\max\\!\\left(\\Delta t_{\\min},\\; \\Delta t\\max(0.1, 0.9 / \\sqrt{\\mathrm{Err}})\\right)$; accepted steps propose $\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{next}} = \\operatorname{clip}\\!\\left(\\Delta t\\min(5, \\max(0.1, 0.9 / \\sqrt{\\mathrm{Err}})),\\; \\Delta t_{\\min},\\; \\Delta t_{\\max}\\right)$ (doubling when $\\mathrm{Err} = 0$). This controller bounds relative state jumps and is distinct from formal embedded truncation-error or Courant-Friedrichs-Lewy (CFL) stability control."
msgstr "若 $\\mathrm{Err} > 1$ 且 $\\Delta t > \\Delta t_{\\min}$，当前步将回滚并以 $\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{new}} = \\max\\!\\left(\\Delta t_{\\min},\\; \\Delta t\\max(0.1, 0.9 / \\sqrt{\\mathrm{Err}})\\right)$ 重试一次；已接受步建议下一步长为 $\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{next}} = \\operatorname{clip}\\!\\left(\\Delta t\\min(5, \\max(0.1, 0.9 / \\sqrt{\\mathrm{Err}})),\\; \\Delta t_{\\min},\\; \\Delta t_{\\max}\\right)$（当 $\\mathrm{Err} = 0$ 时步长加倍）。该控制器约束状态相对跃变幅度，有别于严格的内嵌截断误差控制或库朗-弗里德里希斯-列维条件（Courant-Friedrichs-Lewy, CFL）稳定性控制。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:221
msgid "Transport stability and nonlinear Richards closure"
msgstr "输运稳定性与非线性 Richards 闭合"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:223
#, python-brace-format
msgid "For 1D/multi-D advection-diffusion $\\frac{\\partial c}{\\partial t} + \\nabla\\cdot(\\mathbf{u}c - D\\nabla c) = 0$ on isotropic grid spacing $\\Delta x$ in $d$ spatial dimensions, explicit time stepping is constrained by the Courant-Friedrichs-Lewy (CFL) number, explicit Fourier diffusion number $\\mu$, and cell Peclet number $\\mathrm{Pe}$ (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapter 25):"
msgstr "对于 $d$ 维空间各向同性网格间距 $\\Delta x$ 上的一维/多维平流-扩散方程 $\\frac{\\partial c}{\\partial t} + \\nabla\\cdot(\\mathbf{u}c - D\\nabla c) = 0$，显式时间步进受库朗-弗里德里希斯-列维（Courant-Friedrichs-Lewy, CFL）数、显式傅里叶（Fourier）扩散数 $\\mu$ 与网格佩克莱特（Peclet）数 $\\mathrm{Pe}$ 约束（《生态学分析方法》，第 25 章）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:230
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathrm{CFL} = \\frac{\\lvert u \\rvert\\,\\Delta t}{\\Delta x} \\le C_{\\max},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mu = \\frac{D\\,\\Delta t}{\\Delta x^2} \\le \\frac{1}{2d},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathrm{Pe} = \\frac{\\lvert u \\rvert\\,\\Delta x}{D}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathrm{CFL} = \\frac{\\lvert u \\rvert\\,\\Delta t}{\\Delta x} \\le C_{\\max},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mu = \\frac{D\\,\\Delta t}{\\Delta x^2} \\le \\frac{1}{2d},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathrm{Pe} = \\frac{\\lvert u \\rvert\\,\\Delta x}{D}.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:238
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`apply_advection` (`relic.scientific.transport`) enforces $\\mathrm{CFL} \\le C_{\\max}$ against `transport.numerical.cfl_advection_max` (default `1.0`, bounds `[0.5, 1.0]`) on explicit `\"euler\"` steps and raises `ValueError` on violation (`upwind` supports all integrators; `lax_wendroff`, `superbee`, and `van_leer` require `\"euler\"`; `central` requires `\"implicit_midpoint\"` or `\"crank_nicolson\"`)."
msgstr "`apply_advection`（`relic.scientific.transport`）在显式 `\"euler\"` 步上对照 `transport.numerical.cfl_advection_max`（默认 `1.0`，取值范围 `[0.5, 1.0]`）强制校验 $\\mathrm{CFL} \\le C_{\\max}$，越界时抛出 `ValueError`（`upwind` 支持全部积分器；`lax_wendroff`、`superbee` 与 `van_leer` 要求 `\"euler\"`；`central` 要求 `\"implicit_midpoint\"` 或 `\"crank_nicolson\"`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:245
msgid "Variably saturated vertical soil-water flow obeys the mixed-form Richards equation with van Genuchten (1980) retention and Mualem (1976) hydraulic conductivity:"
msgstr "变饱和土壤水分垂向流动遵循耦合 van Genuchten（1980）持水曲线与 Mualem（1976）导水率的混合形式 Richards 方程："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:249
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\theta(h)}{\\partial t}\n"
"= \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z}\\!\\left[K(h)\\left(\\frac{\\partial h}{\\partial z} + 1\\right)\\right] - S(h),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"S_e = \\left[1 + (\\alpha \\lvert h \\rvert)^n\\right]^{-m} \\;\\; \\left(m = 1 - \\frac{1}{n}\\right),\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\theta(h)}{\\partial t}\n"
"= \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z}\\!\\left[K(h)\\left(\\frac{\\partial h}{\\partial z} + 1\\right)\\right] - S(h),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"S_e = \\left[1 + (\\alpha \\lvert h \\rvert)^n\\right]^{-m} \\;\\; \\left(m = 1 - \\frac{1}{n}\\right),\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:256
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\theta(h) = \\theta_r + S_e(\\theta_s - \\theta_r),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"K(S_e) = K_s S_e^\\ell\\left[1 - \\left(1 - S_e^{1/m}\\right)^m\\right]^2,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\theta(h) = \\theta_r + S_e(\\theta_s - \\theta_r),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"K(S_e) = K_s S_e^\\ell\\left[1 - \\left(1 - S_e^{1/m}\\right)^m\\right]^2,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:262
msgid "routing any saturation or residual-moisture clipping ($\\theta_r \\le \\theta \\le \\theta_s$) into explicit water-budget ledgers."
msgstr "并将任何饱和含水量或残余含水量截断项（$\\theta_r \\le \\theta \\le \\theta_s$）记入显式水量收支账本。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:265
msgid "Conservative spatial remapping and internal cross-domain couplers"
msgstr "空间守恒重映射与内部跨域耦合器"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:267
msgid "Basis-governed spatial remapping"
msgstr "受基准治理的空间重映射"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:269
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Grid-to-grid (`ConservativeRemap`, `ConservativeRegridder`, `BilinearRegridder`, `NearestNeighborRegridder` in `relic.coupling.scales.spatial`) and nested-unit hierarchical operators (`HierarchicalAggregator`, `ScaleManager` in `relic.coupling.scales`) enforce `SpatialQuantityBasis` (`relic.coupling.scales.types`: `intensive`, `cell_total`, `area_density`, `categorical`; see [Mathematical Foundations](foundations.md)). Spherical `latlon` cell areas use SSOT `earth_radius` $R_\\oplus$ as $A = R_\\oplus^2(\\lambda_2 - \\lambda_1)(\\sin\\phi_2 - \\sin\\phi_1)$, and `HierarchicalAggregator` additionally supports neutral-drag effective roughness blending at reference height $z_r$ ($0 < z_{0,i} < z_r$):"
msgstr "网格间算子（`relic.coupling.scales.spatial` 中的 `ConservativeRemap`、`ConservativeRegridder`、`BilinearRegridder`、`NearestNeighborRegridder`）与嵌套单元层级算子（`relic.coupling.scales` 中的 `HierarchicalAggregator`、`ScaleManager`）强制执行 `SpatialQuantityBasis`（`relic.coupling.scales.types`：`intensive`、`cell_total`、`area_density`、`categorical`；参见[数学基础](foundations.md)）。球面 `latlon` 网格面积采用单一事实源（Single Source of Truth, SSOT）地球半径 `earth_radius` $R_\\oplus$ 计算：$A = R_\\oplus^2(\\lambda_2 - \\lambda_1)(\\sin\\phi_2 - \\sin\\phi_1)$；此外，`HierarchicalAggregator` 支持在参考高度 $z_r$（$0 < z_{0,i} < z_r$）处按中性曳力混合有效粗糙度："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:279
msgid ""
"\n"
"z_{0,j} = z_r \\exp\\!\\left[-\\left(\\sum_i \\frac{f_{ij}}{\\ln^2(z_r / z_{0,i})}\\right)^{-1/2}\\right].\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"z_{0,j} = z_r \\exp\\!\\left[-\\left(\\sum_i \\frac{f_{ij}}{\\ln^2(z_r / z_{0,i})}\\right)^{-1/2}\\right].\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:283
msgid "Internal cross-domain coupling ports (`relic.coupling.internal`)"
msgstr "内部跨域耦合端口（`relic.coupling.internal`）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:285
msgid "Three `ScaleCouplingFunctor` ports connect soil, vegetation, and surface-layer variables without duplicating domain process laws (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapters 23--24):"
msgstr "三个 `ScaleCouplingFunctor` 端口在不重复实现各圈层过程定律的前提下连接土壤、植被与近地层变量（《生态学分析方法》，第 23--24 章）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:289
msgid "**`SoilVegetationCoupling` (`relic.coupling.internal.soil_vegetation`)**: Normalizes parametric (`exponential`, `linear`, `beta`) or observed root density across layer thicknesses $\\Delta z_i$ ($\\sum_i \\beta_i \\Delta z_i = 1$) and applies the four-threshold Feddes matric-potential stress factor $\\alpha(\\psi_i) \\in [0, 1]$ ($\\psi_{\\mathrm{wilt}} < \\psi_{\\mathrm{opt,dry}} < \\psi_{\\mathrm{opt,wet}} < \\psi_{\\mathrm{anaer}}$) to potential transpiration $T_p$:"
msgstr "**`SoilVegetationCoupling`（`relic.coupling.internal.soil_vegetation`）**：跨土层厚度 $\\Delta z_i$ 归一化参数化（`exponential`、`linear`、`beta`）或观测根系密度（$\\sum_i \\beta_i \\Delta z_i = 1$），并将四阈值 Feddes 基质势胁迫因子 $\\alpha(\\psi_i) \\in [0, 1]$（$\\psi_{\\mathrm{wilt}} < \\psi_{\\mathrm{opt,dry}} < \\psi_{\\mathrm{opt,wet}} < \\psi_{\\mathrm{anaer}}$）作用于潜在蒸腾 $T_p$："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:296
msgid ""
"\n"
"S_i = \\alpha(\\psi_i)\\,\\beta_i\\,T_p,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"T_{\\mathrm{actual}} = \\sum_i S_i\\,\\Delta z_i \\le T_p.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"S_i = \\alpha(\\psi_i)\\,\\beta_i\\,T_p,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"T_{\\mathrm{actual}} = \\sum_i S_i\\,\\Delta z_i \\le T_p.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:302
msgid "**`BiosphereAtmosphereCoupling` (`relic.coupling.internal.biosphere_atmosphere`)**: Maps friction velocity $u_\\ast > 0$, air temperature $T > 0$, and pressure $P > 0$ to bulk-canopy leaf boundary-layer conductance:"
msgstr "**`BiosphereAtmosphereCoupling`（`relic.coupling.internal.biosphere_atmosphere`）**：将摩擦速度 $u_\\ast > 0$、气温 $T > 0$ 与气压 $P > 0$ 映射为整冠层叶片边界层导度："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:306
msgid ""
"\n"
"g_{b,\\mathrm{ms}} = C_v\\sqrt{\\frac{u_\\ast}{d_{\\mathrm{leaf}}}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"g_{b,\\mathrm{mol}} = g_{b,\\mathrm{ms}}\\frac{P}{R T}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"g_{b,\\mathrm{ms}} = C_v\\sqrt{\\frac{u_\\ast}{d_{\\mathrm{leaf}}}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"g_{b,\\mathrm{mol}} = g_{b,\\mathrm{ms}}\\frac{P}{R T}.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:312
msgid "**`WaterCarbonCoupling` (`relic.coupling.internal.water_carbon`)**: Combines soil-moisture factor $f_{\\mathrm{soil}}(\\theta)$ (`logistic`, `linear`, or `piecewise`), hyperbolic vapour-pressure-deficit factor $f_{\\mathrm{vpd}} = (1 + D / D_{50})^{-1}$, and clamped $Q_{10}$ thermal response $f_T$ into bounded physiological and decomposition modifiers ($f_{\\mathrm{gpp}}$, $f_{Ra}$, $f_{Rh}$, $k_{\\mathrm{dec}}$, and $f_{\\mathrm{overall}}$)."
msgstr "**`WaterCarbonCoupling`（`relic.coupling.internal.water_carbon`）**：综合土壤水分因子 $f_{\\mathrm{soil}}(\\theta)$（`logistic`、`linear` 或 `piecewise`）、双曲饱和水汽压差因子 $f_{\\mathrm{vpd}} = (1 + D / D_{50})^{-1}$ 与限幅 $Q_{10}$ 温度响应 $f_T$，生成有界生理与分解调节因子（$f_{\\mathrm{gpp}}$、$f_{Ra}$、$f_{Rh}$、$k_{\\mathrm{dec}}$ 与 $f_{\\mathrm{overall}}$）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:320
msgid "Transverse hybrid events and saltation-matrix sensitivities"
msgstr "横截混杂事件与跃变矩阵灵敏度"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:322
#, python-brace-format
msgid "For one transversal zero crossing of a scalar guard $g(x, \\boldsymbol{\\theta}, t) = 0$ within an explicit step $[t_0, t_0 + \\Delta t]$ ($g_0 g_1 \\le 0$) followed by a smooth reset map $x^+ = R(x^-, \\boldsymbol{\\theta}, \\tau)$, `relic.computation.solvers.hybrid_events` (`locate_guard_crossing`, `event_time_sensitivity`, `sensitivity_jump`, `saltation_matrix`) locates the crossing time $\\tau$ by linear interpolation and propagates exact first-order state and parameter sensitivities (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapter 28):"
msgstr "对于显式步 $[t_0, t_0 + \\Delta t]$ 内标量守卫函数 $g(x, \\boldsymbol{\\theta}, t) = 0$ 的单次横截过零事件（$g_0 g_1 \\le 0$）及其后的光滑重置映射 $x^+ = R(x^-, \\boldsymbol{\\theta}, \\tau)$，`relic.computation.solvers.hybrid_events`（`locate_guard_crossing`、`event_time_sensitivity`、`sensitivity_jump`、`saltation_matrix`）通过线性插值定位过零时刻 $\\tau$，并传播精确的一阶状态与参数灵敏度（《生态学分析方法》，第 28 章）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:330
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\tau = t_0 + \\Delta t\\,\\frac{g_0}{g_0 - g_1},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\tau}{\\mathrm{d}\\boldsymbol{\\theta}}\n"
"= -\\frac{g_x S^- + g_{\\boldsymbol{\\theta}}}{g_x f^- + g_t},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\tau = t_0 + \\Delta t\\,\\frac{g_0}{g_0 - g_1},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\tau}{\\mathrm{d}\\boldsymbol{\\theta}}\n"
"= -\\frac{g_x S^- + g_{\\boldsymbol{\\theta}}}{g_x f^- + g_t},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:337
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Xi = R_x + \\frac{\\left(f^+ - R_x f^- - R_t\\right) n^{\\mathsf{T}}}{n^{\\mathsf{T}} f^- + g_t}\n"
"\\quad \\left(n = g_x^{\\mathsf{T}}\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"S^+ = R_x S^- + R_{\\boldsymbol{\\theta}}\n"
"+ \\left(R_x f^- + R_t - f^+\\right)\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\tau}{\\mathrm{d}\\boldsymbol{\\theta}},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\Xi = R_x + \\frac{\\left(f^+ - R_x f^- - R_t\\right) n^{\\mathsf{T}}}{n^{\\mathsf{T}} f^- + g_t}\n"
"\\quad \\left(n = g_x^{\\mathsf{T}}\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"S^+ = R_x S^- + R_{\\boldsymbol{\\theta}}\n"
"+ \\left(R_x f^- + R_t - f^+\\right)\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\tau}{\\mathrm{d}\\boldsymbol{\\theta}},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:345
msgid "where $f^-$ and $f^+$ are pre- and post-event vector fields and $S^-$, $S^+$ are pre- and post-event parameter sensitivities. Tangential or grazing trajectories satisfying $\\lvert g_0 - g_1 \\rvert \\le \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{trans}}$ or $\\lvert n^{\\mathsf{T}} f^- + g_t \\rvert \\le \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{trans}}$ (`computation.solvers.hybrid_events.transversality_tolerance`, default `1e-12`) raise `ValueError` without extrapolation. Production consumer: `GDDPhenology` onset diagnostics; simultaneous multi-guard crossings and implicit-solver event location remain `[N]`."
msgstr "其中 $f^-$ 与 $f^+$ 分别为事件前后的向量场，$S^-$ 与 $S^+$ 分别为事件前后的参数灵敏度。满足 $\\lvert g_0 - g_1 \\rvert \\le \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{trans}}$ 或 $\\lvert n^{\\mathsf{T}} f^- + g_t \\rvert \\le \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{trans}}$（`computation.solvers.hybrid_events.transversality_tolerance`，默认 `1e-12`）的相切或擦掠轨迹直接抛出 `ValueError`，不作外推。生产级调用方为 `GDDPhenology` 物候萌发诊断；多守卫同时过零与隐式求解器事件定位仍为 `[N]`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:354
msgid "Stochastic, memory, ALE, DAE, and topology-transition families"
msgstr "随机、记忆、任意拉格朗日-欧拉（Arbitrary Lagrangian-Eulerian, ALE）、DAE 与拓扑跃迁族"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/numerics.md:356
msgid "`relic.stochastic` provides standalone Ito Stochastic Differential Equation (SDE) Euler-Maruyama stepping ($x_{n+1} = x_n + a(x_n, t_n)\\Delta t + B(x_n, t_n)\\Delta W_n$, $\\Delta W_n \\sim \\mathcal{N}(0, \\Delta t\\,I)$, strong order $1/2$), Gillespie direct Stochastic Simulation Algorithm (SSA) reaction jumps ($\\tau = -\\ln u_1 / a_0(x)$, $x^+ = x^- + \\nu_j$), and Monte Carlo ensemble statistics ($\\bar{x} = \\frac{1}{M}\\sum_{m=1}^M x^{(m)}$, $s_x^2 = \\frac{1}{M-1}\\sum_{m=1}^M (x^{(m)} - \\bar{x})^2$). Conservative stochastic forcing acts on flux cochains ($\\mathrm{d}x_{\\mathrm{noise}} = -D_{d-1,h}\\Xi_h\\,\\mathrm{d}W_t$) so closed elemental ledgers remain invariant."
msgstr "`relic.stochastic` 提供独立的伊藤随机微分方程（Ito Stochastic Differential Equation, SDE）Euler-Maruyama 步进（$x_{n+1} = x_n + a(x_n, t_n)\\Delta t + B(x_n, t_n)\\Delta W_n$，$\\Delta W_n \\sim \\mathcal{N}(0, \\Delta t\\,I)$，强收敛阶 $1/2$）、Gillespie 直接随机模拟算法（Stochastic Simulation Algorithm, SSA）反应跳过程（$\\tau = -\\ln u_1 / a_0(x)$，$x^+ = x^- + \\nu_j$）以及蒙特卡洛（Monte Carlo）集合统计量（$\\bar{x} = \\frac{1}{M}\\sum_{m=1}^M x^{(m)}$，$s_x^2 = \\frac{1}{M-1}\\sum_{m=1}^M (x^{(m)} - \\bar{x})^2$）。守恒随机强迫作用于通量上链（$\\mathrm{d}x_{\\mathrm{noise}} = -D_{d-1,h}\\Xi_h\\,\\mathrm{d}W_t$），使封闭元素账本保持不变。"

